<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσδέω</span></b>  (A), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bind on</i> or <i>to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ὕπερον τὸ ξύλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλίσκον πρὸς κύστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσαῖς σειραῖς τὸ τοῦ Ἀπόλλωνος
					ξόανον τῇ βάσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.41
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδήριον ὀξὺ -δησάμενος πρὸς τὸν
					δάκτυλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.28
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥμισυ ἀσκοῦ οἱ προσδέδεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.119
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνας προσδεδέσθαι νυκτερεύοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					22.14
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονῇ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					5.2.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. only,
				<i>attach</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς κάλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἄκρῳ μυρσίνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.195
				</span></i>
			.</div>
